description: Centralized error handling and observability
globs: **/*.dart
alwaysApply: true
---

# Error Handling
- Centralize failure handling (do not scatter try/catch across UI).
- Log all errors to Crashlytics.
- Use analytics for important user-facing events and failures.

# UX Safety
- Never break UI due to exceptions.
- Prefer returning safe states (empty/loading/error) via Providers rather than throwing out of UI.

